#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid ""
"These resolvers refuse names that their threat intelligence flags as malicious (malware, "
"phishing, botnet control), although the DNS check resolved this one. That is a third party’s "
"classification, and it can be wrong."
msgstr ""
"Diese Resolver lehnen Namen ab, die ihre Threat Intelligence als bösartig einstuft (Malware, "
"Phishing, Botnet-Steuerung), obwohl die DNS-Prüfung diesen aufgelöst hat. Das ist die Einstufung "
"eines Dritten und kann falsch sein."

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The name of this host was asked of %(n)s security resolvers (the %(type)s record), as a plain DNS"
" question. Nothing was sent to the host itself."
msgstr ""
"Der Name dieses Hosts wurde %(n)s Sicherheits-Resolvern als gewöhnliche DNS-Frage gestellt (der "
"%(type)s-Eintrag). An den Host selbst wurde nichts gesendet."

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "What each security resolver answered"
msgstr "Was jeder Sicherheits-Resolver geantwortet hat"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "Resolver"
msgstr "Resolver"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "Verdict"
msgstr "Urteil"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "What it answered"
msgstr "Was er geantwortet hat"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "Not blocked"
msgstr "Nicht blockiert"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "No verdict"
msgstr "Kein Urteil"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
msgid "says"
msgstr "meldet"

#: app/templates/assessments/checks/reputation.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A resolver that does not block a name says little: each of them knows only part of the bad names "
"of the internet, and blocking is its own classification. A resolver that did not answer, or "
"answered without saying why, is not counted as a block. Compared with: %(addresses)s (what the "
"DNS check found)."
msgstr ""
"Ein Resolver, der einen Namen nicht blockiert, sagt wenig: Jeder kennt nur einen Teil der "
"schlechten Namen des Internets, und das Blockieren ist eine eigene Einstufung. Ein Resolver, der "
"nicht geantwortet oder ohne Begründung geantwortet hat, zählt nicht als Blockade. Verglichen mit:"
" %(addresses)s (was die DNS-Prüfung gefunden hat)."

