"Every scan stays as it was when it ended; a new scan never changes an old one. What the team "
"decided about a finding belongs to the assessment and counts in every scan, so the report of an "
"older scan shows the decisions of today."
msgstr ""
"Jeder Scan bleibt so, wie er bei seinem Ende war; ein neuer Scan ändert nie einen alten. Was das "
